---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Global Product Representation" description="Your outsourced regional sales force for marine equipment and software." nav="services" page="service-product-representation" mainClass="svc-detail">

  <section class="hero page ph-service sd-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap sd-grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag">Service 5 of 8</span>
        <h1>Global Product Representation</h1>
        <p class="sub">Your outsourced regional sales force for marine equipment and software.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="wrap sd-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/services/">← All services</a><span>/</span><b>Global Product Representation</b></nav>
      
      <div class="sd-top reveal">
        <figure class="sd-pic plate">
          <img src="/images/svc-representation.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 50%" alt="Global Product Representation">
          
        </figure>
        <section class="sd-block first">
          <h4><span>1</span>What we do</h4>
          <p>We serve as the official global sales, business development and commercial representative for international maritime equipment manufacturers and marine software developers. By acting as your outsourced, high-calibre regional sales force, we leverage our established network to position your technical solutions directly in front of key decision-makers at shipyards, shipowners and operating fleets worldwide. We eliminate the high overhead, regulatory complexities and risks of establishing localized entities, delivering immediate market access and accelerated sales cycles through a trusted, global maritime footprint.</p>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
      <section class="sd-block reveal">
        <h4><span>2</span>Why partner with us</h4>
        
        
        <p>When you partner with us for global product representation, you are not just outsourcing your sales; you are integrating a strategic commercial partner dedicated to expanding your market share. We align our success with your revenue growth, providing the local expertise and infrastructure needed to turn complex technical specifications into executed purchase orders.</p>
      </section>
      
      <nav class="sd-pn">
        <a href="/services/engineering/"><span class="k">← Previous</span><span class="t">Engineering Consultancy in Shipbuilding</span></a>
        <a class="sd-all btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services</a>
        <a class="r" href="/services/chartering/"><span class="k">Next →</span><span class="t">Ship Chartering Support</span></a>
      </nav>
      <div class="sd-talk plate reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Talk to our team</span>
        <h3>Interested in Global Product Representation?</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your vessel or project and we'll come back with a clear plan.</p>
        <a class="btn plate" href="/contact/">Enquire now <span class="ar">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
